{"id":2767,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2026年3月26日，中北大学马克思主义学院组织师生赴刘胡兰纪念馆开展思政课教学实践活动。双方签订爱国主义教育实践基地协议并挂牌。在讲解员的引导下，我院师生认真参观了馆内陈列的历史照片、革命文物与场景复原，深刻感悟刘胡兰烈士坚定信念、不屈不挠、敢于担当、勇于奉献的精神，并瞻仰了刘胡兰烈士墓，在庄严肃穆的氛围中深切缅怀革命先烈的崇高精神。</p><p>此次教学实践活动将红色资源转化为生动的思政育人素材，让师生们接受了一次深刻的思想教育和精神洗礼。大家纷纷表示，要将此次实践所学所感融入日常教学，进一步推动思政小课堂与社会大课堂深度融合，切实提升思政育人实效。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jM4CwanlLbL4GsUXNlioRQ7U4T2M4-/YLzvZnmf7nNQ7U8-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMYhRLYhkM8lPL7W7UzC8MlLZLzliM4-ZLRMRUzvZMzQFU46VnlLPn7nFM4WRM49Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4CiM4lJqdKnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=6575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A17C3B7E10BDA645C815572803CA7856/C7EEC1DD/72C78\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 502px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jL47waMmlaLRN8nXRWRM8QfnlCZM87/DUm9ZU4rVL4WfU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfoSyZM1yPL4NYL46fnlr7L4rfMzrfMNMVnR74L4r7MRTFUNCiU4fkM4TFMmnfMz-ZgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGPokyDMzvigtA8pUKcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=6575&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=joR7w4UzvPUmrknX7CbUz6RUz74L7r/VU8CiUzGiUzAfMll0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkMYhRnSyPM4n2Mlnfnm62MRr7L8UbU8MRUmnVozMVUNWFMlV7o7-YL8QFolVRUN7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4CiM4lJqdKnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=6575&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7B7CE174F5DAF7F45D3D9CCCB4E93EBB/5AD8B23F/9ACBA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 505px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jMRLwZMzA2L4T2oXR-8M77YUN7bU87/PLRliMRUDLzCaU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7MShkn1yZnR9ZUz9ZUNUYMlCiL8-DLRNbU478MlnVUzMFMNlPnNr2nzfFo7L8U4vPgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGPokyDMzvigtA8pUKcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=6575&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jM4CwanlLbL4GsUXNlioRQ7U4T2M4-/YLzvZnmf7nNQ7U8-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMYhRLYhkM8lPL7W7UzC8MlLZLzliM4-ZLRMRUzvZMzQFU46VnlLPn7nFM4WRM49Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR7Zg4CiM4lJqdKnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1018&nid=6575&e=.jpg"}